// BESSER's tiny (besser/instances/tiny.py), Part I's hand-made example, in the Exam DSL.
// Three exams whose conflicts form a path, three batches, no weights. Feasible: cost 0.
problem tiny batches 3
students Alice Bob Carla David Eva
exam Math      { Alice Carla }
exam Physics   { Alice Bob Eva }
exam Chemistry { Bob David }

solver { method annealing reads 50 sweeps 10000 seed 7 }
